The report file is optional for the repository if your lecturer requests it separately. Check the submission instructions before uploading documents.

10. Limitations and Future Improvements

• Records are temporary and are lost when the program exits.
• There is no login or user-role system.
• The program uses a command-line interface.
• Future versions could add a database, authentication, stronger input validation, automated unit tests, and a graphical user interface.

